WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.184
They call me Kestrel. That wasn’t my first name.

2
00:00:08.184 --> 00:00:16.369
I was born Mara Vale beneath a clinic light that flickered every six seconds.

3
00:00:16.369 --> 00:00:24.553
My mother gave me one thing the city could not repossess: a copper bird.

4
00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:32.737
At six, the world was market smoke, music, and her hand in mine.

5
00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:40.921
At nine, corporate security took our home and my mother with it. At thirteen, I learned every lock is only a question.

6
00:00:40.921 --> 00:00:49.106
I stole medicine. I told myself that made me good. At sixteen, I stopped a convoy.

7
00:00:49.106 --> 00:00:57.290
The crash took more than the target. I still don’t know their names. At nineteen, my crew sold me out.

8
00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:05.474
I went back for the one they left behind. I lost the arm and found the rule I still live by.

9
00:01:05.474 --> 00:01:13.658
No one gets left behind. A street doctor rebuilt me. I chose a new name. The city wrote the wounds.

10
00:01:13.658 --> 00:01:21.843
I chose what they meant. Origin Dossier turns every scar, debt, promise, enemy, and secret into the runner at your table.

11
00:01:21.843 --> 00:01:30.027
Not a backstory. A life with consequences.
